<title>USA: Atlantic Southeast forms holding company.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Southeast forms holding company.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA, Ga. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Southeast Airlines Inc said on Friday it completed the formation of a holding company called ASA Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>ASA Holdings owns 100 percent of the Atlantic Southeast common stock, the company said.</p>
<p>The reorganization became effective December 31, it said.</p>
<p>((--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
